<title>CHINA: Hopewell hopes to make statement Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Hopewell hopes to make statement Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hopewell Holdings Ltd said it hoped to make an annoucement later on Tuesday but was waiting for further advice from the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong before releasing a statement.</p>
<p>Trading in Hopewell shares was suspended on Tuesday at the request of the company pending an announcement.</p>
<p>&quot;We are waiting for the stock exchange. Further details will be released as soon as possible,&quot; a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Hopewell shares closed at HK$5.10 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
